		<expression>Case 
When ValueIsFilled(AnalyticsHeader_1) Then AnalyticsHeader_1 
When ValueIsFilled(AnalyticsLines1) Then AnalyticsLines1 
When ValueIsFilled(AnalyticsColumns1) Then AnalyticsColumns1
End</expression>
